Terraform
  
  - .terraform/ — provider/module cache
  - *.tfstate, *.tfstate.backup — state files (contain sensitive data)
  - *.tfplan — plan output files
  - *.tfvars — variable files with secrets (but keeps example.tfvars)
  -  .terraform.lock.hcl - Terraform lock file                                                             
      
  
  Secrets & Keys
  
  - *.pem, *.key, *.ppk — private keys
  - terra-key-ec2, terra-key-ec2.pub — your specific key from main.tf
  - .env, secrets.tf — environment and secret files
  - .aws/, credentials — AWS credentials
